    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About Campaign:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure as King Nirvan assigns a crucial quest to Oggnor following his mind-blowing discovery. As Oggnor ventures forth, he encounters Tychun, Xathos, and Atlonus along the way. The tale unfurls with a tapestry of twists and turns, woven with intricate lore and rich narratives. Each encounter brings new challenges, forging bonds of camaraderie and testing the resilience of our heroes against the relentless tide of adversity. Set against a backdrop of stunning landscapes and immersive environments, this epic saga promises an unparalleled adventure that shapes the destiny of the kingdom. Brace yourself for an unforgettable odyssey filled with heart-pounding action and deep-seated mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Build and Train Your Units By Using Resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Upgrade Skills For Next Level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Switch Leader Characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Character Skins Are Available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Buy Character Potions and Spell items from shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Unlock Chests by Orbs and get common or rare items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Survive the highest nights among your friends in the Leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Variety of Zombies available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Great Visuals and Extraordinary 3D graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Magnificent background music and sound effects.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About Campaign:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure as King Nirvan assigns a crucial quest to Oggnor following his mind-blowing discovery. As Oggnor ventures forth, he encounters Tychun, Xathos, and Atlonus along the way. The tale unfurls with a tapestry of twists and turns, woven with intricate lore and rich narratives. Each encounter brings new challenges, forging bonds of camaraderie and testing the resilience of our heroes against the relentless tide of adversity. Set against a backdrop of stunning landscapes and immersive environments, this epic saga promises an unparalleled adventure that shapes the destiny of the kingdom. Brace yourself for an unforgettable odyssey filled with heart-pounding action and deep-seated mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Build and Train Your Units By Using Resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Upgrade Skills For Next Level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Switch Leader Characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Character Skins Are Available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Buy Character Potions and Spell items from shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Unlock Chests by Orbs and get common or rare items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Survive the highest nights among your friends in the Leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Variety of Zombies available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Great Visuals and Extraordinary 3D graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2737 Magnificent background music and sound effects.</p>",
